  "post_content": "<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2013/10/IMG_3831.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px\" /></p>\n<p>Fanzara ha vivido la noche de este martes una emotiva procesi&oacute;n del retorno del Sant&iacute;simo Sepulcro a su ermita, con la participaci&oacute;n de unas quinientas personas.En todo momento la comitiva ha estado acompa&ntilde;ada por la Agrupaci&oacute;n Musical Virgen de Gracia de Vila-real, de cornetas y tambores, hasta el disparo del castillo de fuegos artificiales.</p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/procesionsepulcrofanzara13/img_3755.jpg\" alt=\"img_3755\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/procesionsepulcrofanzara13/img_3756.jpg\" alt=\"img_3756\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/procesionsepulcrofanzara13/img_3757.jpg\" alt=\"img_3757\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/procesionsepulcrofanzara13/img_3758.jpg\" alt=\"img_3758\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/procesionsepulcrofanzara13/img_3759.jpg\" alt=\"img_3759\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/procesionsepulcrofanzara13/img_3760.jpg\" alt=\"img_3760\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/procesionsepulcrofanzara13/img_3761.jpg\" alt=\"img_3761\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/procesionsepulcrofanzara13/img_3763.jpg\" alt=\"img_3763\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/procesi